[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    298[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // `capsule_bb` is inverted and `c2AABBtoPoint` can never accept).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    299[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
